# C070: Several Session operations bypass the connection mutex and async affinity
#
# CONFIRMED — static analysis (data race / callback lifetime)
#
# table_filter, config, memory_used, and changeset_size (session.c:758-845,
# 970-997) access/mutate SQLite Session state without dbmutex or async worker
# routing.  Replacing the filter can decref a callback while SQLite still holds
# its raw context; 64-bit state reads can race native updates.
